          "docs": "Check for membership in a specified list of group IDs, and return from that list the IDs of groups where a specified object is a member. The specified object can be of one of the following types:\r\n- user\r\n- group\r\n- service principal\r\n- organizational contact\r\n- device\r\n- directory object This function is transitive. You can check up to a maximum of 20 groups per request. This function supports all groups provisioned in Microsoft Entra ID. Because Microsoft 365 groups cannot contain other groups"
